  "description": "Adds Shen and reworks official champions 002-007 and 009 as Lucian, Orianna, Briar, Sivir, Kled, Xayah and Yone. Version 0.10.3 uses Yone's three Mod API 0.8 active slots as Q/W/R. W Spirit Cleave is one planted wide slash and one deduplicated target set: any enemy hit grants a base shield, every enemy champion hit raises its tier through the normal five-champion roster, and one delayed settle applies the shield exactly once. Retired Soul Unbound state, body anchors, return AI and E damage ledgers are removed. W attack-speed timing remains a documented fixed-cooldown API approximation. The battle actor keeps all 13 native tags, rectangles and timings while an idempotent RGB-only final-scale pass gives all 54 visible body frames a readable warm face and two-pixel eye cue without changing alpha geometry. Official audio and the existing Rift quality and League-style UI pack remain intact. Built for Teamfight Manager 2 v0.5.0 Mod API 0.8.",
